WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.590
Unit nine. Clean Nails and Hair!

2
00:00:04.542 --> 00:00:08.166
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:11.484
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:15.534
Today we learn about Clean Nails and Hair. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.673 --> 00:00:19.923
Nails. Say it with me. Nails!

6
00:00:23.442 --> 00:00:26.725
Hair. Say it with me. Hair!

7
00:00:30.206 --> 00:00:33.406
Comb. Say it with me. Comb!

8
00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:40.402
Shampoo. Say it with me. Shampoo!

9
00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:47.475
Clippers. Say it with me. Clippers!

10
00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:54.037
Dirt. Say it with me. Dirt!

11
00:00:57.535 --> 00:01:00.735
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

12
00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:07.530
Neat. Say it with me. Neat!

13
00:01:11.037 --> 00:01:19.841
I keep my nails short and clean so dirt and germs cannot hide under them. I wash my hair with shampoo and comb it. A grown-up helps me use the nail clippers.

14
00:01:19.891 --> 00:01:21.059
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.562 --> 00:01:27.713
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.763 --> 00:01:28.913
Comb!

17
00:01:29.669 --> 00:01:34.939
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.989 --> 00:01:36.139
Clean!

19
00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:43.066
Did you know? Germs can hide under long nails, so short nails help keep you healthy!

20
00:01:43.116 --> 00:01:45.067
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.757 --> 00:01:53.719
Think and answer. Why should we keep our nails short and clean?

22
00:01:53.769 --> 00:01:54.919
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.028 --> 00:02:00.946
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.996 --> 00:02:03.692
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

